CORRECTION plan.md 21: demand capping is sound only for flat/nested Union over Mention/Empty leaves under an independent intersection consumer. Intersection, subtraction, restriction, raffination, prefix closure, composition, singleton/literal, unwrap/range/calls/iteration, and Wrap retain compositional bounds. The earlier generic lazy-cursor claim is superseded.
CORRECTION plan.md 22: the earlier spatial_code_* FOL files merely renamed abstract functions and did not bridge Scala code; they were deleted. The replacement bridge exhaustively compares the 28-element finite interval domain and all 28x28 production order/join/meet pairs against an independent semantic oracle with fail-closed decoding.
