CHANGE spatial domain: production symbolic key/fiber-degree inference, quantitative prefix coverage, parameterized puzzle/queens cardinalities, and SCC E-squared laws replace test-only constants.
CHANGE spatial domain: SpatialType.lessOrEqual now checks every mandatory right stratum for a sufficiently strong left witness, including exact-empty handling. The finite bridge exposed a real false comparison for exact{1} <= [must{0},may{0,1}].
CHANGE spatial bridge: the decoder rejects missing/nonconstant/non-singleton/out-of-universe patterns, non-binary lowers, noncanonical uppers, and duplicate strata instead of approximating them away; all 28 values and all 28x28 order/join/meet pairs are checked.
CHANGE recurrence: decreasing recursive costs close to additive*geomSeries(branching,rounds); non-decreasing/unproved recursion remains explicitly unknown.
CHANGE Z3 process wrapper: missing executable is a hard typed failure; stdin/stdout/stderr are handled concurrently; timeout kills descendants and parent; degraded/partial results are diagnosed and never cached; ResultPathLength shares the wrapper.

CHANGE zipper recursion: recursive helper calls are automatically lowered only for the union-saturating fragment; unsupported calls fail explicitly. Nonrecursive zipper helpers bind both path and space arguments.
CHANGE zipper fixpoint: DemandFixpointEngine uses shared prefix cells, frozen prior-round observations, and fresh round wrappers. State-dependent range, tails-intersection, unwrap, negative operations, generic iteration, callbacks, calls, folds, and nested fixpoints use the construction-lazy exact synchronous fallback.
CHANGE zipper fixpoint: direct Datalog and SCC execute through the exact synchronous fallback; the causal wrapped positive fragment remains prefix-demanded. Regressions cover zero construction rounds, first-observation saturation, fresh rounds, and focused tail propagation.
CHANGE zipper/trie: native Patricia aggregates, cheap child-frontier hints, memoized size/emptiness, cursor probes, smaller-frontier virtual intersection, and generic operation-local aggregate propagation remove irrelevant-operand scans without forcing virtual materialization.
CHANGE graph: loop binder constants are alpha-normalized for iteration/fold/fixpoint/extract roles while semantic constants remain significant; renamed and nested binders share, non-alpha terms do not.
CHANGE SCC: direct mutual reachability is enabled on reference/trie/zipper/graph, included in both benchmark reports, parity/spatial output, and structural proof obligations; recursive reference/trie routines were repaired separately.

CHANGE proof determinism: Syntax.iterk uses a deterministic syntax digest while preserving final binder substitution; zero-arity and nested closed/executable programs are regression tested. Two independent cornerstone generations were byte-identical (parity SHA-256 66f6ab4e...f59; spatial SHA-256 0eab71b6...dcc).
CHANGE proof honesty: closed tautological cornerstone solver files and their acceptance validators were deleted. Full-program FOL is labeled axiomatized contract composition, not an independent Scala implementation proof.
CHANGE proof gate: aunt, Game of Life, semi-naive Datalog, and puzzle full-open obligations are mandatory runtime-generated files. Required gates parse manifests, negative controls, frontier/termination/operational coverage, ownership, documentation invariants, and named counterexample queries.
CHANGE proof long mode: unspecified defaults become alphabet a,b,c, maximum path length 4 (121 paths), and eight solver workers; explicit CLI values retain precedence and solver result order remains deterministic.
CHANGE puzzle obligation: contextFor preserves every explicit syntax path and maps out-of-universe constants to zero. The correct width-125 universe contains epsilon; boards A=TL.1.2.3, B=TR.1.2.3, C=BL.2.1.3; transitions A-R-B, B-L-A, A-D-C, C-U-A; and every intermediate action/destination/tile path read by the routine.
CHANGE puzzle obligation: production evaluation and an independent path-algebra evaluator validate all four direction provenances before emitting three universal relations plus exact witnesses A->{B,C}, B->{A}, C->{A}. The pipeline requires all nine named rows and caps witness width at 128.

